// Your series budget (S5, decision 014). Every series from this host passes through one of these three
// before it's sent. Grafana Cloud's free tier allows 10,000 active series for all hosts together
// (contracts/metrics.yaml). With no rules, everything is sent.
//
// Rules are Prometheus relabelling (https://grafana.com/docs/alloy/latest/reference/components/prometheus/prometheus.relabel/):
//   rule { source_labels = ["__name__"]  regex = "node_(cpu|memory)_.*"  action = "keep" }
//   rule { regex = "id"  action = "labeldrop" }

declare "host" {
	argument "forward_to" { }

	prometheus.relabel "rules" {
		forward_to = argument.forward_to.value

		// Keep essential host metrics: CPU, memory, load, root disk, and network throughput
		rule {
			source_labels = ["__name__"]
			regex         = "node_(cpu_seconds_total|memory_MemTotal_bytes|memory_MemAvailable_bytes|load1|load5|load15|filesystem_avail_bytes|filesystem_size_bytes|network_receive_bytes_total|network_transmit_bytes_total)"
			action        = "keep"
		}

		// Drop virtual, bridge, loopback and docker interfaces
		rule {
			source_labels = ["device"]
			regex         = "(veth.*|br-.*|docker.*|lo)"
			action        = "drop"
		}

		// Drop ephemeral and virtual filesystems
		rule {
			source_labels = ["fstype"]
			regex         = "(tmpfs|overlay|squashfs|iso9660|devtmpfs)"
			action        = "drop"
		}
	}

	export "receiver" {
		value = prometheus.relabel.rules.receiver
	}
}

declare "containers" {
	argument "forward_to" { }

	prometheus.relabel "rules" {
		forward_to = argument.forward_to.value

		// Keep only metrics for named containers (drop root cgroup slices)
		rule {
			source_labels = ["name"]
			regex         = ".+"
			action        = "keep"
		}

		// Keep only CPU and memory metrics needed by dashboards and capacity planning
		rule {
			source_labels = ["__name__"]
			regex         = "container_(memory_working_set_bytes|cpu_usage_seconds_total)"
			action        = "keep"
		}

		// Drop container ID, image hashes, and container labels that change on every deployment
		rule {
			regex  = "(id|image|container_label_.*)"
			action = "labeldrop"
		}
	}

	export "receiver" {
		value = prometheus.relabel.rules.receiver
	}
}

declare "services" {
	argument "forward_to" { }

	prometheus.relabel "rules" {
		forward_to = argument.forward_to.value

		// Keep contract metrics and Traefik service metrics
		rule {
			source_labels = ["__name__"]
			regex         = "(lab_.*|traefik_service_.*)"
			action        = "keep"
		}
	}

	export "receiver" {
		value = prometheus.relabel.rules.receiver
	}
}
